Spec: Test Suite

Platform: ExUnit

Purpose:
  Verify the application from outside ./lib, one test file per module
    under test.

Structure:
  ./<%= @app %>: Tests of the domain
  ./<%= @app %>_web: Tests of the web interface, through the endpoint
  ./support: Cases and fixtures shared by the tests
  ./test_helper.exs: ExUnit start

Can read:
  ../lib

Must:
  A test file mirrors the path of its subject: `lib/<%= @app %>/accounts.ex` is tested by `./<%= @app %>/accounts_test.exs`.
  A spec's Scenario has a matching test before its task is marked done.
  The suite runs with `mix test`, and one file with `mix test path/to/file_test.exs`.

Must not:
  Define application code.
